8. DF Column to Series

Write a Pandas program to convert the first column of a DataFrame as a Series.

Original DataFrame
   col1  col2  col3
0     1     4     7
1     2     5     5
2     3     6     8
3     4     9    12
4     7     5     1
5    11     0    11

1st column as a Series:
0     1
1     2
2     3
3     4
4     7
5    11
Name: col1, dtype: int64
<class 'pandas.core.series.Series'>

